# Python sources are hashed byte-for-byte to validate cached grids/indices
# (src/utils/cache_manager.py) and the locked poker evaluator/preflop baselines.
# Force LF on checkout everywhere so a Windows clone (core.autocrlf=true) doesn't
# see CRLF, mismatch every hash, and silently re-solve all 32 grids.
*.py text eol=lf
